{"version":1,"slug":"Others__General_Awareness_-_General_Studies_-_Super_Practice_-_SSC_SUPER_PRACTICE_38920_(20Q)","path":"Others/General Awareness - General Studies - Super Practice - SSC SUPER PRACTICE 38920 (20Q).html","title":"devgagan","provider":"Others","category":"General Awareness - General Studies - Super Practice - SSC SUPER PRACTICE 38920 (20Q).html","durationMinutes":60,"totalQuestions":20,"sectionsLocked":false,"sections":null,"questions":[{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If (4x  -  7y)<sup>2 </sup>+ (5y  -  3z)<sup>2</sup> = 0, then find x : y : z = ?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; (4x - 7y)<sup>2 </sup>+ (5y - 3z)<sup>2</sup> = 0, &#2340;&#2379; x : y : z = ? &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">21 : 20 : 15</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">21 : 20 : 15</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">21 : 12 : 20</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">21 : 12 : 20</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">22 : 21 : 20</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">22 : 21 : 20</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">21 : 20 : 12</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">21 : 20 : 12</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>If a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> = 0</p><p>=&gt; a = 0 and b = 0</p><p>(4x  -  7y)<sup>2</sup> + (5y  -  3z)<sup>2</sup> = 0</p><p>4x  -  7y = 0</p><p>4x = 7y</p><p>x : y = 7 : 4........(i)</p><p>5y  -  3z = 0</p><p>5y = 3z</p><p>y : z = 3 : 5.......(ii)</p><p>multiply eq(i) by 3 and eq(ii) by 4 we get,</p><p>x : y : z = 21 : 12 : 20</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2 </sup>+ 266 = 2 (9a + 8b  -  11c), then (ab  -  bc  -  ca)  -  128 is :</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2 </sup>+ 266 = 2 (9a + 8b - 11c), &#2340;&#2379; (ab - bc - ca) - 128 &#2361;&#2376;:</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">156</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">156</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">343</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">343</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">131</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">131</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">243</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">243</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup> + 266 = 2(9a + 8b  -  11c)</p><p>a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup> + 266 = 18a + 16b  -  22c</p><p>a<sup>2</sup>  -  18a + b<sup>2</sup>  -  16b + c<sup>2</sup> + 22c + 266 = 0</p><p>a<sup>2</sup> -18a + 81 + b<sup>2</sup> + 64  -  16b + c<sup>2</sup> + 121 + 22c = 0</p><p>(a  -  9)<sup>2</sup> + (b  -  8)<sup>2</sup> + (c + 11)<sup>2</sup> = 0</p><p>a = 9, b = 8 and c = -11</p><p>(ab  -  bc  -  ca)  -  128 = (9*8  -  (8 * -11)  -  (-11 * 9)  -  128</p><p>=&gt; (72 + 88 + 99)  -  128 = 259  -  128</p><p>=&gt; 131</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If 25x<sup>2</sup> + 4y<sup>2</sup> + 4z<sup>2</sup> = 4 (5x  -  y + 6z)  -  41, then the value of (xy + 2z) is :</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 25x<sup>2</sup> + 4y<sup>2</sup> + 4z<sup>2</sup> = 4 (5x - y + 6z) - 41, &#2340;&#2379; (xy + 2z) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2361;&#2376;:</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">28/5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">28/5</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">15/7</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">15/7</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">29/5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">29/5</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">32/5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">32/5</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>25x<sup>2</sup> + 4y<sup>2</sup> + 4z<sup>2</sup> = 4(5x  -  y + 6z)  -  41</p><p>=&gt; 25x<sup>2</sup> + 4y<sup>2</sup> + 4z<sup>2</sup>  -  20x + 4y  -  24z + 41= 0</p><p>=&gt; (5x)<sup>2</sup>  -  2*5x * 2 + 2<sup>2</sup> + (2y)<sup>2</sup> + 2 * 2y * 1 + 1<sup>2</sup> + (2z)<sup>2</sup>  -  2 * 2z * 6 + 6<sup>2</sup> = 0</p><p>(5x  -  2)<sup>2</sup> + (2y + 1)<sup>2</sup> + (2z  -  6)<sup>2</sup> = 0</p><p>(5x  -  2)<sup>2</sup> = 0</p><p>5x  -  2 = 0</p><p>x = 2/5</p><p>similarly,</p><p>y = -1/2 and z = 3</p><p>(xy + 2z) = 2/5 * (-1/2) + 2 * 3 = 29/5</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If 7<sup>a</sup> = 11<sup>b</sup> = 77<sup>c</sup>, then find the value of c = ?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 7<sup>a</sup> = 11<sup>b</sup> = 77<sup>c</sup>, &#2340;&#2379; c &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319; = ?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">1/a  -  a/b + 1/c = 0</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1/a  -  a/b + 1/c = 0</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">1/a  -  1/b  -  1/c = 0</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1/a  -  1/b  -  1/c = 0</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">1/a + 1/b + 1/c = 0</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1/a + 1/b + 1/c = 0</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">1/a + 1/b  -  1/c = 0</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1/a + 1/b  -  1/c = 0</span>"],"correct_option_id":3,"solution":"<p>7<sup>a</sup> = 11<sup>b</sup> = 77<sup>c</sup></p><p>Let 7<sup>a</sup> = 11<sup>b</sup> = 77<sup>c</sup> = k</p><p>7 = k<sup>1/a</sup>............(i)</p><p>11 = k<sup>1/b</sup>............(ii)</p><p>77 = k<sup>1/c</sup>...........(iii)</p><p>7 * 11 = 77</p><p>k<sup>1/a</sup> * k<sup>1/b</sup> = k<sup>1/c</sup>............using eq(i), (ii) and (iii)</p><p>k<sup>1/A</sup> <sup>+ 1/B</sup> = k<sup>1/C</sup></p><p>1/a + 1/b = 1/c</p><p>1/a + 1/b  -  1/c = 0</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If 4<sup>x</sup> = 7<sup>y</sup> = 28<sup>-z</sup>, then which option is correct?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 4<sup>x</sup> = 7<sup>y</sup> = 28<sup>-z</sup>, &#2340;&#2379; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2366; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346; &#2360;&#2361;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">1/x  -  2/y  -  2/z = 0</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1/x  -  2/y  -  2/z = 0</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">1/x + 2/y + 1/z = 0</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1/x + 2/y + 1/z = 0</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">2/x + 1/y  -  1/z = 0</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2/x + 1/y  -  1/z = 0</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">1/x + 1/y + 1/z = 0</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1/x + 1/y + 1/z = 0</span>"],"correct_option_id":3,"solution":"<p>4<sup>x</sup> = 7<sup>y</sup> = 28<sup>-z</sup></p><p>Let 4<sup>x</sup> = 7<sup>y</sup> = 28<sup>-z</sup> = k</p><p>4 = k<sup>1/x</sup>............(i)</p><p>7 = k<sup>1/y</sup>............(ii)</p><p>28 = k<sup>-1/z</sup>...........(iii)</p><p>4 * 7 = 28</p><p>k<sup>1/x</sup> * k<sup>1/y</sup> = k<sup>-1/z</sup>............using eq(i), (ii) and (iii)</p><p>k<sup>1/x</sup> <sup>+ 1/y</sup> = k<sup>-1/z</sup></p><p>1/x + 1/y = -1/z</p><p>1/x + 1/y + 1/z = 0</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If x + y + z = 3, xy + yz + zx = -4 and xyz = -4, then (x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup>) is equal to ______ .</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; x + y + z = 3, xy + yz + zx = -4 &#2324;&#2352; xyz = -4 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; (x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup>) &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2352;&#2366;&#2348;&#2352; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">60</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">60</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">62</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">62</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">51</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">51</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">58</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">58</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> = (x + y + z)<sup>2</sup>  -  2(xy + yz + zx)</p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> = (3)<sup>2</sup>  -  2(-4)</p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> = 9 + 8</p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> = 17</p><p>x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup> = (x + y + z)(x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup>  -  xy  -  yz  -  zx) + 3xyz</p><p>x<sup>3 </sup>+ y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup> = 3[17  -  (-4)] + 3(-4)</p><p>x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup> = 63  -  12</p><p>x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup> = 51</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If &#945; + &#946; + &#947; = 0, then (5&#946;<sup>2</sup> + 2&#945;<sup>2</sup> + &#947;<sup>2</sup>)/( 6&#946;<sup>2</sup> + 3&#945;<sup>2 </sup>+ 2&#945;&#946;) = ?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#945; + &#946; + &#947; = 0, &#2347;&#2367;&#2352; (5&#946;<sup>2</sup> + 2&#945;<sup>2</sup> + &#947;<sup>2</sup>)/( 6&#946;<sup>2</sup> + 3&#945;<sup>2 </sup>+ 2&#945;&#946;) = ?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">1.25</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1.25</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">1</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1</span>"],"correct_option_id":3,"solution":"<p>&#945; + &#946; + &#947; = 0</p><p>&#947; = - (&#945; + &#946;)</p><p>substitute &#947; = -(&#945; + &#946;) into the formula :</p><p>{5&#946;<sup>2</sup> + 2&#945;<sup>2</sup> + [-(&#945; + &#946;)<sup>2</sup>]/{ 6&#946;<sup>2</sup> + 3&#945;<sup>2 </sup>+ 2&#945;&#946;}</p><p>=&gt; [5&#946;<sup>2</sup> + 2&#945;<sup>2</sup> + (&#945; + &#946;)<sup>2</sup>] / {6&#946;<sup>2</sup> + 3&#945;<sup>2 </sup>+ 2&#945;&#946;}</p><p>=&gt; (5&#946;<sup>2</sup> + 2&#945;<sup>2</sup> + &#945;<sup>2</sup> + 2&#945;&#946; + &#946;<sup>2</sup>)/( 6&#946;<sup>2</sup> + 3&#945;<sup>2 </sup>+ 2&#945;&#946;)</p><p>=&gt; (5&#946;<sup>2</sup> + 3&#945;<sup>2</sup> + 2&#945;&#946; + &#946;<sup>2</sup>)/( 6&#946;<sup>2</sup> + 3&#945;<sup>2 </sup>+ 2&#945;&#946;)</p><p>=&gt; (6&#946;<sup>2</sup> + 3&#945;<sup>2</sup> + 2&#945;&#946;)/(6&#946;<sup>2</sup> + 3&#945;<sup>2 </sup>+ 2&#945;&#946;)</p><p>=&gt; (6&#946;<sup>2</sup> + 3&#945;<sup>2 </sup>+ 2&#945;&#946;)/(6&#946;<sup>2</sup> + 3&#945;<sup>2 </sup>+ 2&#945;&#946;)</p><p>=&gt; 1</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If 2a + 4b + 5c = 0, then what is the value of (8a<sup>3</sup> + 64b<sup>3</sup> + 125c<sup>3</sup>) ?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 2a + 4b + 5c = 0, &#2340;&#2379; (8a<sup>3</sup> + 64b<sup>3</sup> + 125c<sup>3</sup>) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">90abc</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">90&#2319;&#2348;&#2368;&#2360;&#2368;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">100abc</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">100&#2319;&#2348;&#2368;&#2360;&#2368;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">120abc</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">120&#2319;&#2348;&#2368;&#2360;&#2368;</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">125abc</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">125&#2319;&#2348;&#2368;&#2360;&#2368;</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>We use the identity for the sum of cubes: a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + c<sup>3</sup> - 3abc</p><p>=&gt; (a + b + c)(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup> - ab - bc - ca)</p><p><b>Formula Used:</b></p><p>8a<sup>3</sup> + 64b<sup>3</sup> + 125c<sup>3</sup>  -  3(2a)(4b)(5c) = (2a + 4b + 5c)[(2a)<sup>2</sup> + (4b)<sup>2</sup> + (5c)<sup>2</sup>  -  (2a)(4b) - (4b)(5c) - (5c)(2a)]</p><p><b>Calculation:</b></p><p>We have,</p><p>=&gt; 2a + 4b + 5c = 0</p><p>Using the formula for the sum of cubes, we get:</p><p>=&gt; 8a<sup>3</sup> + 64b<sup>3</sup> + 125c<sup>3</sup>  -  120abc = (2a + 4b + 5c)(4a<sup>2</sup> + 16b<sup>2</sup> + 25c<sup>2</sup> - 8ab - 20bc - 10ca)</p><p>=&gt; 8a<sup>3</sup> + 64b<sup>3</sup> + 125c<sup>3</sup>  -  120abc = 0</p><p>=&gt; 8a<sup>3</sup> + 64b<sup>3</sup> + 125c<sup>3</sup> = 120abc</p><p><b>The value of 8a<sup>3</sup> + 64b<sup>3</sup> + 125c<sup>3</sup> is 120abc.</b></p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If x = 120, y = 122, z = 118, then find the value of x<sup>3 </sup>+ y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup>  -  3xyz.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; x = 120, y = 122, z = 118, &#2340;&#2379; x<sup>3 </sup>+ y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup> - 3xyz &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">4020</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">4020</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">4320</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">4320</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">4510</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">4510</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">4810</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">4810</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup> - 3xyz = (x + y + z)(x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> - xy - yz - zx)</p><p>If x + y + z = 0, then x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup> - 3xyz = 0</p><p><b>Calculation:</b></p><p>We have,</p><p>=&gt; x = 120, y = 122, z = 118</p><p>=&gt; x + y + z = 120 + 122 + 118 = 360</p><p>=&gt; x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup> - 3xyz = (x + y + z)(x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> - xy - yz - zx)</p><p>=&gt; x<sup>2</sup> = 120<sup>2</sup> = 14400</p><p>=&gt; y<sup>2</sup> = 122<sup>2</sup> = 14884</p><p>=&gt; z<sup>2</sup> = 118<sup>2</sup> = 13924</p><p>=&gt; xy = 120  X  122 = 14640</p><p>=&gt; yz = 122  X  118 = 14396</p><p>=&gt; zx = 118  X  120 = 14160</p><p>=&gt; x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> - xy - yz - zx = 14400 + 14884 + 13924 - 14640 - 14396 - 14160</p><p>=&gt; x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> - xy - yz - zx = 43208 - 43196</p><p>=&gt; x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> - xy - yz - zx = 12</p><p>=&gt; x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup> - 3xyz = 360  X  12</p><p>=&gt; x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup> - 3xyz = 4320</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If 4a + 4b + c = 0, then find the value of (9a<sup>2</sup> + 9b<sup>2</sup> + 9c<sup>2</sup>)/(5c<sup>2</sup>  -  18ab).</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 4a + 4b + c = 0, &#2340;&#2379; (9a<sup>2</sup> + 9b<sup>2</sup> + 9c<sup>2</sup>)/(5c<sup>2</sup> - 18ab) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">0.25</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">0.25</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">1</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">0.5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">0.5</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>Let c = 0</p><p>Then,</p><p>4a = -4b</p><p>a = -b</p><p>putting value of a and c in (9a<sup>2</sup> + 9b<sup>2</sup> + 9c<sup>2</sup>)/(5c<sup>2</sup>  -  18ab) we get,</p><p>[9(-b)<sup>2</sup> + 9b<sup>2</sup> + 9*(0)<sup>2</sup>]/[5(0)<sup>2</sup>  -  18(-b)b)</p><p>=&gt; (9b<sup>2</sup> + 9b<sup>2</sup>)/18b<sup>2</sup> = 18b<sup>2</sup>/18b<sup>2</sup> = 1</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If a/b + b/c + c/a = 28 and b/a + c/b + a/c = 7, then find the value of a<sup>2</sup>/b<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup>/c<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup>/a<sup>2</sup> ?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; a/b + b/c + c/a = 28 &#2324;&#2352; b/a + c/b + a/c = 7 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; a<sup>2</sup>/b<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup>/c<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup>/a<sup>2</sup> &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">680</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">680</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">770</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">770</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">720</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">720</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">700</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">700</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>Let a/b = x, b/c = y and c/a = z</p><p>xyz = 1 (as the products of the ratios cycle back to 1)</p><p>x + y + z = 28............(i)</p><p>1/x + 1/y + 1/z = 7</p><p>(yz + zx + xy)/xyz = 7</p><p>yz + zx + xy = 7........(ii)</p><p>a<sup>2</sup>/b<sup>2</sup>+ b<sup>2</sup>/c<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup>/a<sup>2</sup> = x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup></p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2 </sup>= (x + y + z)<sup>2</sup>  -  2(xy + yz + zx)</p><p>putting values from (i) and (ii) we get,</p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2 </sup>= (28)<sup>2</sup>  -  2(7)</p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> = 784  -  14</p><p>a<sup>2</sup>/b<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup>/c<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup>/a<sup>2 </sup>= 770</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup> = ab + bc + ca, then find the value of</p><p>(25a<sup>4</sup> + 15b<sup>4</sup> + 18c<sup>4</sup>)/(128a<sup>2</sup>b<sup>2</sup> + 56b<sup>2</sup>c<sup>2</sup> + 48c<sup>2</sup>a<sup>2</sup>) is :</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup> = ab + bc + ca, &#2340;&#2379; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;</p><p>(25a<sup>4</sup> + 15b<sup>4</sup> + 18c<sup>4</sup>)/(128a<sup>2</sup>b<sup>2</sup> + 56b<sup>2</sup>c<sup>2</sup> + 48c<sup>2</sup>a<sup>2</sup>) &#2361;&#2376;:</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">4</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">4</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">1</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">0.5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">0.5</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">0.25</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">0.25</span>"],"correct_option_id":3,"solution":"<p>a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup> = ab + bc + ca</p><p>(a  -  b)<sup>2</sup> + (b  -  c)<sup>2</sup> + (c  -  a)<sup>2</sup> = 0</p><p>a = b = c</p><p>let a = b = c = k then,</p><p>25a<sup>4</sup> + 15b<sup>4</sup> + 18c<sup>4</sup> = 25k<sup>4</sup> + 15k<sup>4</sup> + 18k<sup>4</sup> = 58k<sup>4</sup></p><p>128a<sup>2</sup>b<sup>2</sup> + 56b<sup>2</sup>c<sup>2</sup> + 48c<sup>2</sup>a<sup>2</sup> = 128k<sup>4</sup> + 56k<sup>4</sup> + 48k<sup>4</sup> = 232k<sup>4</sup></p><p>(25a<sup>4</sup> + 15b<sup>4</sup> + 18c<sup>4</sup>)/(128a<sup>2</sup>b<sup>2</sup> + 56b<sup>2</sup>c<sup>2</sup> + 48c<sup>2</sup>a<sup>2</sup>) = 58/232</p><p>=&gt; 58/232 = 1/4 or 0.25</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If 2x  -  y + 3z = 0, then find the value of (4x<sup>2</sup>/yz  -  y<sup>2</sup>/2xz + 27z<sup>2</sup>/2xy).</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 2x - y + 3z = 0, &#2340;&#2379; (4x<sup>2</sup>/yz - y<sup>2</sup>/2xz + 27z<sup>2</sup>/2xy) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">-9</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-9</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">19</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">19</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">9</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">9</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">-19</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">-19</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>4x<sup>2</sup>/yz  -  y<sup>2</sup>/2xz + 27z<sup>2</sup>/2xy</p><p>8x<sup>3</sup>  -  y<sup>3</sup> + 27z<sup>3</sup>/2xyz</p><p>Given that 2x  -  y + 3z = 0</p><p>We know that if a + b + c = 0, then a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + c<sup>3</sup> = 3abc</p><p>So, [(2x)<sup>3</sup>  -  y<sup>3</sup> + (3z)<sup>3</sup>]/2xyz</p><p>[3(2x)(-y)(3z)]/2xyz = -18/2</p><p>-9</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If x + y + z = 150, then find [(x-30)<sup>3</sup> + (y-40)<sup>3</sup> + (z-80)<sup>3</sup>]/(x-30)(y-40)(z-80)]?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; x + y + z = 150, &#2340;&#2379; [(x-30)<sup>3</sup> + (y-40)<sup>3</sup> + (z-80)<sup>3</sup>]/(x-30)(y-40)(z-80)] &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">4</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">4</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">5</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3</span>"],"correct_option_id":3,"solution":"<p>x + y + z = 150</p><p>let x  -  30 = X, y  -  40 = Y and z  -  80 = Z</p><p>then, x = X + 30, y = Y + 40 and z = Z + 80</p><p>(X + 30) + (Y + 40) + (Z + 80) = 150</p><p>X + Y + Z = 0</p><p>(X<sup>3</sup> + Y<sup>3</sup> + Z<sup>3</sup>) = (X + Y + Z)(X<sup>2 </sup>+ Y<sup>2</sup> + Z<sup>2</sup>  -  XY  -  YZ  -  ZX) + 3XYZ</p><p>X<sup>3</sup> + Y<sup>3</sup> + Z<sup>3</sup> = 3XYZ</p><p>[(x-30)<sup>3</sup> + (y-40)<sup>3</sup> + (z-80)<sup>3</sup>]/[(x-30)(y-40)(z-80)] = 3XYZ/XYZ</p><p>= 3</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If a = 408, b = -188 and c = -184, then find the value of</p><p>[(a-b)<sup>2</sup>+(b-c)<sup>2</sup>+(c-a)<sup>2</sup>]/(a<sup>3</sup>+b<sup>3</sup>+c<sup>3</sup>-3abc)].</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; a = 408, b = -188 &#2324;&#2352; c = -184 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;</p><p>[(a-b)<sup>2</sup>+(b-c)<sup>2</sup>+(c-a)<sup>2</sup>]/(a<sup>3</sup>+b<sup>3</sup>+c<sup>3</sup>-3abc)].</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">0.5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">0.5</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">1/18</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1/18</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">1/9</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1/9</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + c<sup>3</sup> - 3abc = (a + b + c)/2  X  [(a  -  b)<sup>2</sup> + (b  -  c)<sup>2</sup> + (c  -  a)<sup>2</sup>]</p><p>[(a-b)<sup>2</sup>+(b-c)<sup>2</sup>+(c-a)<sup>2</sup>]/[(a<sup>3</sup>+b<sup>3</sup>+c<sup>3</sup>-3abc)] = [(a-b)<sup>2</sup>+(b-c)<sup>2</sup>+(c-a)<sup>2</sup>]/{(a + b + c)/2  X  [(a  -  b)<sup>2</sup> + (b  -  c)<sup>2</sup> + (c  -  a)<sup>2</sup>]}</p><p>=&gt; 2/(a + b + c) = 2/(408  -  188  -  184) = 2/36</p><p>=&gt; 1/18</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If (a<sup>3</sup>+b<sup>3</sup>+c<sup>3</sup>-3abc) = 330, and (a+b+c) = 11, find the value of (a-b)<sup>2</sup>+(b-c)<sup>2</sup>+(c-a)<sup>2</sup>.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; (a<sup>3</sup>+b<sup>3</sup>+c<sup>3</sup>-3abc) = 330, &#2324;&#2352; (a+b+c) = 11, &#2340;&#2379; (a-b)<sup>2</sup>+(b-c)<sup>2</sup>+(c-a)<sup>2</sup> &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">52</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">52</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">60</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">60</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">50</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">50</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">55</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">55</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>(a<sup>3</sup> + b<sup>3</sup> + c<sup>3</sup> - 3abc) = 1/2 (a + b + c) [(a - b)<sup>2</sup> + (b - c)<sup>2</sup>+(c - a)<sup>2</sup>]</p><p>=&gt; 330 = 1/2  X  11 (a - b)<sup>2</sup> + (b - c)<sup>2</sup>+(c - a)<sup>2</sup>.</p><p>=&gt; (a - b)<sup>2</sup> + (b - c)<sup>2</sup>+(c - a)<sup>2</sup> = 660/11</p><p>=&gt; (a - b)<sup>2</sup> + (b - c)<sup>2</sup>+(c - a)<sup>2</sup> = 60</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If a  -  b  -  c = 0, then [(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup>)/(b<sup>2</sup> + ac)]<sup>4</sup> = ?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; a - b - c = 0, &#2340;&#2379; [(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup>)/(b<sup>2</sup> + ac)]<sup>4</sup> = ?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">4</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">4</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">8</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">8</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">16</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">16</span>"],"correct_option_id":3,"solution":"<p>a  -  b  -  c = 0</p><p>a  -  c = b</p><p>squaring both sides we get,</p><p>(a  -  c)<sup>2</sup> = b<sup>2</sup></p><p>a<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup>  -  2ac = b<sup>2</sup></p><p>a<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup> = b<sup>2</sup> + 2ac</p><p>by adding b<sup>2</sup> to both sides we get,</p><p>a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup> = 2b<sup>2</sup> + 2ac</p><p>(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup>)/(b<sup>2</sup> + ac) = 2</p><p>[(a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup>)/(b<sup>2</sup> + ac)]<sup>4 </sup>= 2<sup>4</sup></p><p>=&gt; 16</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>If x + y + z = xyz = 1/x + 1/y + 1/z = 1, then find x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup> + 5.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; x + y + z = xyz = 1/x + 1/y + 1/z = 1, &#2340;&#2379; x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup> + 5 &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">1</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">4</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">4</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">6</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">6</span>"],"correct_option_id":3,"solution":"<p>Formula used :</p><p>(x + y + z)<sup>2</sup> = x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> + 2(xy + yz + zx)</p><p>And x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup> = (x + y + z) * (x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup>  -  xy  -  yz  -  zx) + 3xyz</p><p>Given,</p><p>1/x + 1/y + 1/z = 1</p><p>(yz + xz + xy)/xyz = 1</p><p>(yz+ xz + xy) = 1</p><p>x + y + z = 1</p><p>squaring both sides,</p><p>(x + y + z)<sup>2</sup> = 1<sup>2</sup></p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> + 2(xy + yz + zx) = 1</p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> + 2 * 1 = 1</p><p>x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup> = 1  -  2 = - 1</p><p>x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup><sub> </sub>= (x + y + z) * (x<sup>2</sup> + y<sup>2</sup> + z<sup>2</sup>  -  xy  -  yz  -  zx) + 3xyz</p><p>=&gt; 1 * (-1  -  1) + 3 = -2 + 3 = 1</p><p>x<sup>3</sup> + y<sup>3</sup> + z<sup>3</sup> + 5 = 1 + 5 = 6</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p><img width=368 height=52 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26408/image001.png\"></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p><img width=368 height=52 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26408/image001.png\"></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">1</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">0.5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">0.5</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">4</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">4</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p><img width=257 height=52 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26408/image002.png\"></p><p><img width=432 height=44 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26408/image003.png\"></p><p><img width=241 height=44 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26408/image004.png\"></p><p>=&gt; (a + b + c)/(a + b + c) = 1</p><p><b>Express method :</b></p><p>Let put a = b = c = 1</p><p>So,</p><p><img width=257 height=52 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26408/image002.png\"></p><p><img width=268 height=52 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p26408/image005.png\"></p><p>=&gt; 1/3 + 1/3 + 1/3 = 1</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>What is the value of (1/a  -  1/b  -  1/c) if, [(4a  -  9)/a]  -  [(5b  -  9)/b] + [(3c + 9)/c] = 0?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>(1/a - 1/b - 1/c) &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367;, [(4a - 9)/a] - [(5b - 9)/b] + [(3c + 9)/c] = 0?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">2/9</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">2/9</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">3/5</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">3/5</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">1/3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1/3</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">1/4</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">1/4</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>[(4a  -  9)/a]  -  [(5b  -  9)/b] + [(3c + 9)/c] = 0</p><p>On taking a, b and c as common from the respective terms</p><p>=&gt; [a(4  -  9/a)/a]  -  [b(5  -  9/b)/b] + [c(3 + 9/c)/c] = 0</p><p>(4  -  9/a)  -  (5  -  9/b) + (3 + 9/c) = 0</p><p>4  -  5 + 3 = 9a  -  9/b  -  9/c</p><p>1/a  -  1/b  -  1/c = 2/9</p>","marks":2,"section":null}]}